OL,3,ASouth Korea shortens war games with US,
OL,4,Aciting Washington request
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after Donald Trump announced
OL,7,Fplans to curtail exercises with South
OL,8,FKorea, citing his "very good"
OL,9,Frelationship with North Korea's Kim
OL,10,FJong Un. He also accused Seoul of
OL,11,Frefusing to take part in action against
OL,12,FIran.
